WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.040
Brooks appeared in every answer.

00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:04.400
But it wasn't everyone's first choice.

00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:07.700
In Recoscope's November sixth
running-shoes snapshot,

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:10.960
Brooks appeared in all
twelve usable answers.

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:13.880
ASICS and Saucony
each appeared in ten.

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:16.820
Then we isolated the
comparative rankings.

00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:19.860
ChatGPT and Claude
put Brooks first.

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:22.820
Gemini and Perplexity
put ASICS first.

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:25.640
That's twelve out of twelve
mentions for Brooks,

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:28.420
but two out of four
comparative first places.

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:31.240
For brand owners,
those are different measures.

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:34.540
Mention frequency shows how
often a brand appears.

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:38.280
Comparative rank shows where it lands
in an explicit ranking.

00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:39.480
Track both.

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:43.040
These captured answers do not
establish product quality.

00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:45.940
Explore benchmark at
getrecoscope.com.
